('KAKAO-5080228739', '피에프', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 데스크 무응답', '목요일부터 방파콩 캐디 데스크에 전화하는데 계속 받지 않습니다. 앱에서 대신 연락해 주실 수 있나요?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 06:14:12+07', '2026-09-16 05:50:35+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0916', 'Sig, Jonas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong - couldn''t make myself understood', 'Rang Bangpakong caddy master. I said caddy, 19 Sep, 8:20, four players. She said ''yes yes'' then asked me something in Thai I couldn''t follow and it went nowhere. Is there anyone there who speaks English? Everyone I''ve spoken to this week has the same story about Bangpakong.', NULL, 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 06:23:54+07', '2026-09-16 06:58:52+07'),
('U40d7b60e966379a644d820f5c155f5a8', 'Smith, Allan', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Eastern Star - simplest thing made hard', 'All I want is to book caddy 73 at Eastern Star for 10:00 on 19 Sep. Phone, LINE, in person - none of it works reliably. Please talk to them about taking bookings through MyCaddiPro.', NULL, 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 05:36:35+07', '2026-09-16 05:39:53+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0885', 'Saito, Toshikatsu', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside - simplest thing made hard', 'All I want is to book caddy 28 at Bangpakong Riverside for 9:00 on 18 Sep. Phone, LINE, in person - none of it works reliably. Please talk to them about taking bookings through MyCaddiPro. Happy to talk to someone about it. Bangpakong used to be fine for caddies. Something has changed.', NULL, 'in_progress', 'high', 'Waiting on the course to call back.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 07:24:59+07', '2026-09-16 07:24:59+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0570', 'Kwang-Bae, Lee', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No caddies available at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Called Bangpakong Riverside for 16 Sep and was told no caddies available. It''s a Wednesday. How can a course have no caddies on a Wednesday? We''re four players. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 07:12:30+07', '2026-09-16 07:12:30+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0745', 'Nilsson, Tomas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booking a caddy at Bangpakong Riverside is impossible by phone', 'We play Bangpakong Riverside every couple of weeks and every time it''s the same. Phone unanswered. Turn up on the day and hope. Please put their caddy booking in the app.', NULL, 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 21:55:07+07', '2026-09-15 21:55:07+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1061', 'Wilkinson, Neil', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Phone booking at Pattaya CC = guesswork', 'Every time I call Pattaya CC for a caddy it''s a guessing game whether they understood. Last week I turned up and they had me down for a different day. Not blaming the staff, but the process is hopeless.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Collecting these to send to the course together.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:44:51+07', '2026-09-15 20:44:51+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1173', 'Moss, Ray', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Told to just turn up and wait at Bangpakong', 'Bangpakong won''t take a caddy booking for 19 Sep. ''Come at 6, wait, maybe have.'' We come from Pattaya, that''s an hour each way on a maybe. Not good enough.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'in_progress', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:38:19+07', '2026-09-15 20:38:19+07'),
('KAKAO-5080228739', '피에프', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 리버사이드 전화 예약 의사소통 문제', '방파콩 리버사이드에 캐디 예약 전화를 했는데 영어도 한국어도 안 통해서 예약이 됐는지 모르겠습니다. 9월 19일 7:50 4명입니다. 확인 부탁드립니다. 저희 조 모두 같은 생각입니다.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:37:28+07', '2026-09-15 20:37:28+07'),
('KAKAO-5016025554', '김현수', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 무단 교체', '방파콩에 캐디 85번 예약했는데 다른 캐디가 나왔고 아무 설명이 없었습니다. 앱에서 확정 예약이 되면 좋겠습니다. 여러 번 말씀드린 내용입니다.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 18:53:25+07', '2026-09-15 18:53:25+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0882', 'Ruggieri, Pierre', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside short of caddies every weekend', 'Is there any way for the app to show which courses actually have caddies? Royal Lakeside has been short every Wednesday this month. We''d rather know before driving out. I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 17:15:22+07', '2026-09-15 17:15:22+07'),
('Ud6ad7cf92502b449c38538cf358b21d6', 'Erik Lundman', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No way to reach Bangpakong Riverside for a caddy', 'Honestly the booking process at Bangpakong Riverside is broken. Phone unanswered for two days. I just want caddy 72 again for 16 Sep, she was great last time.', 'JGTS', 'in_progress', 'urgent', 'Waiting on the course to call back.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 09:15:26+07', '2026-09-15 09:15:26+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0608', 'Lee, Mr', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Spent most of Thursday trying to book caddies at Bangpakong Riverside for our group. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there. Our whole group feels the same.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 09:08:17+07', '2026-09-15 09:08:17+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0929', 'Smith, Craig', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Got nowhere on the phone with Rayong Green Valley', 'Tried to book caddy 30 at Rayong Green Valley for 17 Sep. The conversation was ''hello? hello? caddy? ok'' then silence. I have no idea if anything is booked. This needs a booking form in the app. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', NULL, 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 21:07:07+07', '2026-09-14 21:07:07+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0885', 'Saito, Toshikatsu', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Spent most of Tuesday trying to book caddies at Bangpakong Riverside for our group. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there.', NULL, 'in_progress', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 20:19:39+07', '2026-09-14 20:19:39+07'),
('U68d252ed72808f46e96056d723c62a21', 'Paul Anderson', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy booking at Bangpakong - what a process', 'To book a caddy at Bangpakong: call, no answer. Call again, no English. Call again, told to call the pro shop. Pro shop says call caddy master. It''s 17 Sep we want, 7:30. Can someone sort this? I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 19:12:21+07', '2026-09-14 19:12:21+07'),
('MANUAL-1787279354491-zdr0rd1', 'Hirai Nobuyoshi', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Told to just turn up and wait at Eastern Star', 'Eastern Star won''t take a caddy booking for 12 Sep. ''Come at 6, wait, maybe have.'' We come from Pattaya, that''s an hour each way on a maybe. Not good enough. This is the third time I''m raising it.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'in_progress', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 19:01:44+07', '2026-09-14 19:01:44+07'),
('GOOGLE-112062616158452388613', '정용철', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 전화 연결이 안 돼요', '방파콩 캐디 마스터 번호로 계속 전화하는데 연결이 안 됩니다. 9월 18일 12:30 티타임인데 캐디 예약을 못 하고 있습니다. 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 14:42:13+07', '2026-09-14 14:42:13+07'),
('KAKAO-5002920885', '타이거', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 예약 전화를 안 받습니다', '9월 14일 라운드 캐디 예약하려고 방파콩에 14번이나 전화했는데 아무도 받지 않습니다. 다른 연락 방법이 있나요? 저희 조 모두 같은 생각입니다.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 12:23:56+07', '2026-09-14 12:23:56+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0506', 'Kawai, Steve', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Nobody answers the caddy line at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Rang Bangpakong Riverside 11 times Tuesday between 9 and 11 to book a caddy for 15 Sep. It just rings out. There''s no voicemail, no LINE, nothing. How are we meant to book? Our whole group feels the same.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 11:24:32+07', '2026-09-14 11:24:32+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0772', 'Opic, Brittany', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy desk at Bangpakong Riverside not answering', 'Called Bangpakong Riverside caddy desk Wednesday morning and again in the afternoon. Nobody there. The pro shop said ''call caddy master'' and gave me the same number. Going round in circles.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 08:41:26+07', '2026-09-14 08:41:26+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0851', 'Raavi, Janne', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside - please put caddy booking in the app', 'Can MyCaddiPro take caddy bookings for Bangpakong Riverside? The phone process is hopeless - took me 7 calls over two days to book for 15 Sep and I still don''t have a caddy number.', NULL, 'in_progress', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 08:31:40+07', '2026-09-14 08:31:40+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0847', 'Pumpa, Larry', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies run out by 9am at Green Valley', 'Green Valley said they had caddies when I called. Got there for our 11:00 time and they''d all gone out with the earlier groups. Nobody thought to hold one for the booking. This is the third time I''m raising it.', NULL, 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 07:36:38+07', '2026-09-14 07:36:38+07'),
