('TRGG-GUEST-0288', 'Ford, Nim', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya Country Club only had one caddy for four of us', 'Turned up at Pattaya Country Club on 20 Aug having phoned ahead and they had ONE caddy for our fourball. Told the rest of us to carry. Booking ahead means nothing there.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-08-21 17:30:42+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-20 15:30:42+07', '2026-08-21 17:30:42+07'),
('manual_1782722392854_16', 'Dollard, Dave', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya Country Club: caddy booked, caddy missing', 'Booking at Pattaya Country Club confirmed for 19 Aug 8:40, four caddies. Two showed. We had to share and it slowed the whole course down behind us. The marshal blamed us. Please pass this on to the course.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-20 01:37:00+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-19 22:37:00+07', '2026-08-20 01:37:00+07'),
('MANUAL-1785991985247-9vb7caj', 'Nick Hutchins', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Green Valley only had one caddy for four of us', 'Turned up at Green Valley on 19 Aug having phoned ahead and they had ONE caddy for our fourball. Told the rest of us to carry. Booking ahead means nothing there.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Confirmed the booking directly with the caddy master and messaged the reporter.', '2026-08-22 04:34:20+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-19 16:34:20+07', '2026-08-22 04:34:20+07'),
('manual_1782722392854_16', 'Dollard, Dave', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Told to just turn up and wait at Green Valley', 'Green Valley won''t take a caddy booking for 18 Aug. ''Come at 6, wait, maybe have.'' We come from Pattaya, that''s an hour each way on a maybe. Not good enough. This is the third time I''m raising it.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-20 13:21:49+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-18 13:21:49+07', '2026-08-20 13:21:49+07'),
('U421d50777e918bcd403b997ffff98359', '강 동주', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '로얄 레이크사이드 전화 연결이 안 돼요', '로얄 레이크사이드 캐디 마스터 번호로 계속 전화하는데 연결이 안 됩니다. 8월 18일 12:10 티타임인데 캐디 예약을 못 하고 있습니다.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', 'Passed to the course. They say bookings by phone only, 7:00 to 16:00.', '2026-08-19 00:48:56+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-18 10:48:56+07', '2026-08-19 00:48:56+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0856', 'Ratchana, Rose', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies run out by 9am at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Bangpakong Riverside said they had caddies when I called. Got there for our 8:40 time and they''d all gone out with the earlier groups. Nobody thought to hold one for the booking. I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-20 09:55:27+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-18 09:55:27+07', '2026-08-20 09:55:27+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0395', 'Hill, DeHaven', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Eastern Star', 'Spent most of Saturday trying to book caddies at Eastern Star for our group. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-18 09:50:06+07', '2026-08-18 09:50:06+07'),
