('TRGG-HCP-20260629170837-27', 'Stanton, Brian', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy 46 at Rayong Green Valley - booked, not there', 'I specifically asked for caddy 46 at Rayong Green Valley on 14 Aug, confirmed by phone twice. On the day she was out with another group. They gave me a girl who''d started that week. What''s the point of booking? We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Spoke to the caddy desk on the reporter''s behalf. Booking now in their book.', '2026-08-17 09:04:03+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-16 13:04:03+07', '2026-08-17 09:04:03+07'),
('MANUAL-1785898714588-7dwe1j4', 'Takashi Nakajima', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booked caddy replaced without asking at Royal Lakeside', 'Booked caddy 62 at Royal Lakeside, she didn''t show, they sent someone else who didn''t know the greens. Nobody told us until we were on the tee. Can the app do proper caddy booking with confirmation? We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-18 22:33:47+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-16 10:33:47+07', '2026-08-18 22:33:47+07'),
('U214f2fe47e1681fbb26f0aba95930d64', 'Alan Thomas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside - phone rings out', 'Can the app help with this? I''ve been trying to book a caddy at Royal Lakeside for our 19 Aug game. The line either rings out or goes engaged. I gave up after 14 attempts.', NULL, 'resolved', 'high', 'Confirmed the booking directly with the caddy master and messaged the reporter.', '2026-08-18 07:46:22+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-16 07:46:22+07', '2026-08-18 07:46:22+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0378', 'Hatfield, Tim', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya Country Club - ''no caddy'' again', 'Second week running Pattaya Country Club says no caddies for our group. We''ve played there for years. Is it the busloads of tour groups? Can anything be done through the app?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-14 21:54:30+07', '2026-08-14 21:54:30+07'),
('KAKAO-5080228739', '피에프', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '파타야 컨트리클럽 캐디 예약 절차 불편', '파타야 컨트리클럽 캐디 예약하려면 프로샵, 캐디 마스터, 다시 프로샵… 계속 돌려보냅니다. 8월 17일 7:50 티타임 캐디 확인이 안 됩니다. 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Confirmed the booking directly with the caddy master and messaged the reporter.', '2026-08-17 09:25:22+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-14 21:25:22+07', '2026-08-17 09:25:22+07'),
('U3920142e22dc56dadb2ac3eac53ccf7f', 'Johns, Colin', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booking a caddy at Green Valley is too hard', 'Why is booking a caddy at Green Valley so difficult? Phone only, phone rarely answered, no English, no confirmation. Every other part of the round I can do in the app. Please add caddy booking for Green Valley.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-15 02:12:41+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-14 21:12:41+07', '2026-08-15 02:12:41+07'),
('Uf49bff661cad1d8ddb658c4740b7ed9e', 'Pro Pon', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya CC - couldn''t make myself understood', 'Rang Pattaya CC caddy master. I said caddy, 14 Aug, 7:10, four players. She said ''yes yes'' then asked me something in Thai I couldn''t follow and it went nowhere. Is there anyone there who speaks English?', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-14 15:16:32+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-14 13:16:32+07', '2026-08-14 15:16:32+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0675', 'McEwan, John', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Too many hoops to book a caddy at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Booking a caddy at Bangpakong Riverside for 14 Aug: no online option, phone unreliable, and when you do get through they want you to call back the day before to ''confirm''. Then they still don''t have your name.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Spoke to the caddy desk on the reporter''s behalf. Booking now in their book.', '2026-08-16 01:46:48+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-13 13:46:48+07', '2026-08-16 01:46:48+07'),
