('KAKAO-5002920885', '타이거', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '이스턴 스타 캐디가 없다고 합니다', '8월 7일 이스턴 스타 라운드에 캐디 예약하려니 캐디가 없다고 합니다. 금요일인데 캐디가 없다는 게 말이 되나요? 4명입니다.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Spoke to the caddy desk on the reporter''s behalf. Booking now in their book.', '2026-08-09 19:49:38+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-07 19:49:38+07', '2026-08-09 19:49:38+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0521', 'Keun-Oh, Hyun', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Rayong Green Valley caddy booking needs fixing', 'The app tells me to phone Rayong Green Valley to book a caddy. I did. 6 times. This is 2026, surely the course can take a booking through the app like the tee time? Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-10 05:25:43+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-07 17:25:43+07', '2026-08-10 05:25:43+07'),
('KAKAO-5042182372', '홍지형', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '로얄 레이크사이드 캐디 예약 전화를 안 받습니다', '8월 8일 라운드 캐디 예약하려고 로얄 레이크사이드에 4번이나 전화했는데 아무도 받지 않습니다. 다른 연락 방법이 있나요? 저희 조 모두 같은 생각입니다.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-08 02:48:59+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-07 06:48:59+07', '2026-08-08 02:48:59+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0863', 'Refvik, Arnfin', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No caddies available at Royal Lakeside', 'Called Royal Lakeside for 8 Aug and was told no caddies available. It''s a Saturday. How can a course have no caddies on a Saturday? We''re four players. Please pass this on to the course.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-06 22:42:51+07', '2026-08-06 22:42:51+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1019', 'Trewern, Craig', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Eastern Star no-show caddy, no apology', 'Our group had three caddies booked at Eastern Star. One turned up. The other two just didn''t appear and nobody at the course seemed to care. We paid the caddy fee up front too.', NULL, 'in_progress', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-06 14:40:37+07', '2026-08-06 14:40:37+07'),
('manual_1782722392854_16', 'Dollard, Dave', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Told to just turn up and wait at Green Valley', 'Green Valley won''t take a caddy booking for 4 Aug. ''Come at 6, wait, maybe have.'' We come from Pattaya, that''s an hour each way on a maybe. Not good enough. Please pass this on to the course.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-07 03:45:20+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-06 13:45:20+07', '2026-08-07 03:45:20+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0929', 'Smith, Craig', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Eastern Star short of caddies every weekend', 'Is there any way for the app to show which courses actually have caddies? Eastern Star has been short every Thursday this month. We''d rather know before driving out. Happy to talk to someone about it.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-08-07 02:38:16+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-06 12:38:16+07', '2026-08-07 02:38:16+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0994', 'Terrell, Lindsay', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies didn''t come to the tee at Eastern Star', 'We were on the 1st tee at Eastern Star at 10:40 on 6 Aug waiting for our caddies. Starter kept saying ''coming coming''. Twenty minutes later we went without them. Slow play all day. This is the third time I''m raising it.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-06 18:45:32+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-06 10:45:32+07', '2026-08-06 18:45:32+07'),
('MANUAL-1783645617187-6vn2ak0', 'BAEGERFIELD ROD', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya CC - ''no caddy'' again', 'Second week running Pattaya CC says no caddies for our group. We''ve played there for years. Is it the busloads of tour groups? Can anything be done through the app? This is the third time I''m raising it.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'high', 'Spoke to the caddy desk on the reporter''s behalf. Booking now in their book.', '2026-08-05 23:34:54+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 15:34:54+07', '2026-08-05 23:34:54+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0120', 'Brocklehurst, Gordon', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Can''t confirm my caddy at Rayong Green Valley', 'I think I have a caddy booked at Rayong Green Valley for 6 Aug but I can''t get anyone to confirm it. No booking reference, no message, nothing. The whole thing runs on hope. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', NULL, 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-07 13:36:36+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 13:36:36+07', '2026-08-07 13:36:36+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0655', 'Martin, Doug', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside only had one caddy for four of us', 'Turned up at Royal Lakeside on 4 Aug having phoned ahead and they had ONE caddy for our fourball. Told the rest of us to carry. Booking ahead means nothing there. Please pass this on to the course.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'urgent', NULL, '2026-08-06 09:24:02+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 07:24:02+07', '2026-08-06 09:24:02+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0215', 'Dantini, Bob', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Rayong Green Valley caddy booking phone never picked up', 'Tried the caddy booking number for Rayong Green Valley on and off all day. No answer. Then someone picked up at 4pm and told me to call back tomorrow. For a tee time on 6 Aug. Our whole group feels the same.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-06 11:47:59+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-04 11:47:59+07', '2026-08-06 11:47:59+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0830', 'Pilnick, Ron', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside - phone rings out', 'Can the app help with this? I''ve been trying to book a caddy at Royal Lakeside for our 4 Aug game. The line either rings out or goes engaged. I gave up after 6 attempts.', 'JGTS', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-03 12:08:10+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-03 10:08:10+07', '2026-08-03 12:08:10+07');
